%I A400461 #14 Oct 18 2026 00:31:37
%S A400461 2,18,170,2196,30928,468793,7382132,119840427
%N A400461 Number of one-sided polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 15-faced Voronoi cell of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201).
%C A400461 The cell is a 15-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^6 4^3 5^2 6^2 7^2 faces) arising as the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201); its honeycomb has 24 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 15 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to lattice translation and the proper (orientation-preserving) symmetries of the honeycomb.
%C A400461 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 24 modulo lattice translations (12 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A400461 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026 (method precedent; roundness benchmark).
%H A400461 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">Certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search: code, certificates, catalog (MINT)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A400461 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
%o A400461 (C++) // See A400460.
%Y A400461 Cf. A398957, A398958, A398959 (Josehedron polyforms, same enumerator); A385028, A397707-A397709 (polyforms on other space-filler honeycombs).
